  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 709.25 Recordkeeping",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 709.25 Recordkeeping. If the department approves an extension of the 24-hour limit to take repeat samples pursuant to Env-Dw 709.15(c), the owner of the PWS shall maintain a record of the approval for at least 5 years from the date of the extension.\n\nSource. #10771, eff 2-1-15; ss by 14343, eff 8-22-25, EXPIRES: 8-22-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-dw700.html"
